---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="SuratKu — Surat Resmi, Selesai dalam Menit">
  <main class="marketing-page">
    <nav class="marketing-nav">
      <a href="/" class="marketing-brand"
        ><img src="/images/logo-suratku.png" alt="Logo SuratKu" /><span
          ><strong>SuratKu</strong><small>DOCUMENT BUILDER</small></span
        ></a
      >
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#fitur">Fitur</a><a href="#cara-kerja">Cara kerja</a><a href="#template"
          >Template</a>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a href="/login" class="nav-login">Masuk</a><a href="/register" class="nav-register"
          >Mulai gratis <span>→</span></a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="marketing-hero">
      <div class="hero-glow"></div><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="hero-kicker"><span></span>Platform dokumen resmi untuk bisnis modern</div>
        <h1>Surat perusahaan yang <em>siap dikirim,</em> bukan sekadar diketik.</h1>
        <p>
          Buat, sesuaikan, simpan, dan unduh surat resmi dalam hitungan menit. Format selalu
          konsisten—tanpa mengatur ulang dokumen dari nol.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/register" class="hero-primary">Buat surat pertama <span>→</span></a><a
            href="#cara-kerja"
            class="hero-secondary"><i>▶</i> Lihat cara kerja</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-proof">
          <div class="proof-avatars"><span>SK</span><span>HR</span><span>GA</span></div><div>
            <strong>Lebih cepat. Lebih konsisten.</strong><small
              >Dibangun untuk administrasi perusahaan.</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Contoh dokumen SuratKu">
        <div class="visual-chip chip-top">
          <i>✓</i><span><strong>Siap diunduh</strong><small>Format PDF A4</small></span>
        </div>
        <article class="hero-document">
          <header>
            <img src="/images/logo-suratku.png" alt="Logo SuratKu" /><div>
              <strong>PT SURATKU INDONESIA</strong><small>Dokumen resmi perusahaan</small>
            </div>
          </header><div class="doc-rule"></div><p class="doc-date">Bandung, 4 September 2026</p><div
            class="doc-title"
          >
            <strong>SURAT KETERANGAN KERJA</strong><span>Nomor: 014/SK/HR/IX/2026</span>
          </div><dl>
            <div><dt>Nama</dt><dd>: Putra Apriandi</dd></div><div>
              <dt>Jabatan</dt><dd>: Operations Manager</dd>
            </div><div><dt>Perusahaan</dt><dd>: PT SuratKu Indonesia</dd></div>
          </dl><p>
            Dengan ini menerangkan bahwa nama tersebut merupakan karyawan aktif dan menjalankan
            tanggung jawabnya secara profesional.
          </p><p>Surat ini dibuat untuk dipergunakan sebagaimana mestinya.</p><div class="doc-sign">
            <span>Hormat kami,</span><b>Puji Ermanto</b><small>Human Capital Manager</small>
          </div>
        </article>
        <div class="visual-chip chip-bottom">
          <i>⌁</i><span><strong>24+ jenis surat</strong><small>Siap digunakan</small></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="trust-strip">
      <span>DIBUAT UNTUK</span><div>
        <b>Human Resources</b><b>General Affairs</b><b>Operations</b><b>Business Owner</b>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="fitur" class="feature-section section-wrap">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <span class="section-kicker">BEKERJA LEBIH CERDAS</span><h2>
          Satu ruang kerja untuk seluruh siklus surat.
        </h2><p>
          Dari template sampai PDF final, setiap langkah dirancang agar mudah dipahami dan tetap
          terlihat profesional.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-bento">
        <article class="feature-large">
          <span class="feature-number">01</span><div class="mini-editor">
            <div><b>B</b><i>I</i><u>U</u><span>☰</span><span>≡</span></div><p>
              <strong>SURAT PENAWARAN KERJA SAMA</strong>
            </p><p>Dengan hormat, melalui surat ini kami mengajukan...</p>
          </div><h3>Editor dokumen yang terasa familiar</h3><p>
            Atur judul, paragraf, warna, daftar, dan alignment sambil melihat hasilnya langsung.
          </p>
        </article><article>
          <span class="feature-icon">▤</span><h3>Template fleksibel</h3><p>
            Gunakan template siap pakai, buat sendiri, atau impor langsung dari Word.
          </p>
        </article><article>
          <span class="feature-icon">↓</span><h3>PDF siap kirim</h3><p>
            Preview A4 proporsional dan unduh PDF profesional dalam satu klik.
          </p>
        </article><article>
          <span class="feature-icon">⌕</span><h3>Arsip selalu rapi</h3><p>
            Cari, edit, dan kelola seluruh surat perusahaan dari satu dashboard.
          </p>
        </article><article class="feature-dark">
          <span class="feature-icon">✦</span><h3>Identitas konsisten</h3><p>
            Logo, nama perusahaan, alamat, font, dan penandatangan mengikuti profil.
          </p><div class="consistency-line">
            <i></i><span>Brand consistency</span><strong>100%</strong>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="cara-kerja" class="workflow-section">
      <div class="section-wrap workflow-grid">
        <div class="workflow-copy">
          <span class="section-kicker gold">ALUR SEDERHANA</span><h2>
            Dari kebutuhan menjadi dokumen final.
          </h2><p>
            Tidak perlu mahir Microsoft Word. SuratKu menjaga struktur dokumen agar hasil akhir
            tetap formal dan enak dibaca.
          </p><a href="/register">Coba sekarang <span>→</span></a>
        </div><ol>
          <li>
            <span>01</span><div>
              <strong>Pilih jenis atau template</strong><p>
                Mulai dari format profesional atau template perusahaan.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li><li>
            <span>02</span><div>
              <strong>Isi dan sesuaikan dokumen</strong><p>
                Gunakan editor modern dengan preview realtime.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li><li>
            <span>03</span><div>
              <strong>Simpan dan download PDF</strong><p>
                Arsipkan sebagai draf atau final, lalu unduh dokumen A4.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="template" class="template-showcase section-wrap">
      <div class="section-intro centered">
        <span class="section-kicker">KATALOG PROFESIONAL</span><h2>
          Satu aplikasi, berbagai kebutuhan surat.
        </h2><p>Pilih format yang tepat untuk komunikasi internal maupun eksternal.</p>
      </div><div class="template-tags">
        <span>Surat Penawaran</span><span>Surat Permohonan</span><span>Surat Undangan</span><span
          >SK Mutasi</span
        ><span>Surat Keterangan Kerja</span><span>Surat Peringatan</span><span>Berita Acara</span
        ><span>Surat Kerja Sama</span><span>+ template Anda sendiri</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="final-cta section-wrap">
      <div>
        <span>Mulai lebih rapi hari ini</span><h2>
          Administrasi profesional dimulai dari surat yang tepat.
        </h2><p>Buat akun dan siapkan dokumen resmi pertama Anda bersama SuratKu.</p>
      </div><a href="/register">Mulai gratis sekarang <span>→</span></a>
    </section>
    <footer class="marketing-footer">
      <a href="/" class="marketing-brand"
        ><img src="/images/logo-suratku.png" alt="" /><span
          ><strong>SuratKu</strong><small>DOCUMENT BUILDER</small></span
        ></a
      ><p>Dokumen resmi. Proses lebih pasti.</p><span>© 2026 SuratKu. Semua hak dilindungi.</span>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .marketing-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #f6f8fc;
    color: #111a2d;
  }
  .marketing-nav {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex;
    width: min(1240px, calc(100% - 48px));
    height: 84px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin: auto;
  }
  .marketing-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 11px;
    color: #111a2d;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .marketing-brand img {
    width: 45px;
    height: 45px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    object-fit: cover;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px #10203d2b;
  }
  .marketing-brand span {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .marketing-brand strong {
    font-size: 19px;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
  }
  .marketing-brand small {
    color: #8a94a5;
    font-size: 7px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  }
  .nav-links,
  .nav-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .nav-links a,
  .nav-login {
    color: #5f6b7d;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 650;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover,
  .nav-login:hover {
    color: #1d4ed8;
  }
  .nav-register,
  .hero-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #172b4d;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 750;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 9px 24px #172b4d29;
  }
  .nav-register {
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0 17px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .marketing-hero {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    width: min(1240px, calc(100% - 48px));
    min-height: 690px;
    grid-template-columns: 1.03fr 0.97fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 80px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 42px 0 82px;
  }
  .hero-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2%;
    right: -20%;
    width: 720px;
    height: 720px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #d9e8ff, transparent 67%);
  }
  .hero-copy,
  .hero-visual {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .hero-kicker {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    color: #3c5a88;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .hero-kicker span {
    width: 28px;
    height: 2px;
    background: #d6aa36;
  }
  .hero-copy h1 {
    max-width: 690px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 5.5vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 740;
    line-height: 0.99;
    letter-spacing: -3.7px;
  }
  .hero-copy h1 em {
    display: block;
    color: #2563eb;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .hero-copy > p {
    max-width: 610px;
    margin: 27px 0 31px;
    color: #697487;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.72;
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .hero-primary {
    min-height: 52px;
    padding: 0 21px;
    background: #2563eb;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .hero-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 50px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    padding: 0 18px;
    border: 1px solid #dae1ec;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #435067;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .hero-secondary i {
    display: grid;
    width: 25px;
    height: 25px;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #edf4ff;
    color: #2563eb;
    font-size: 8px;
  }
  .hero-proof {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 31px;
  }
  .proof-avatars {
    display: flex;
  }
  .proof-avatars span {
    display: grid;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    place-items: center;
    margin-left: -7px;
    border: 3px solid #f6f8fc;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #e8eff9;
    color: #233b63;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 850;
  }
  .proof-avatars span:first-child {
    margin-left: 0;
    background: #172b4d;
    color: #f3c84c;
  }
  .hero-proof > div:last-child {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .hero-proof strong {
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .hero-proof small {
    color: #8590a1;
    font-size: 9px;
  }
  .hero-visual {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 590px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .hero-document {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 435px;
    min-height: 565px;
    padding: 36px 39px;
    border: 1px solid #dfe4eb;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: #fffefa;
    box-shadow: 0 38px 80px #14233c24;
    transform: rotate(1.6deg);
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .hero-document header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .hero-document header img {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .hero-document header div,
  .doc-sign {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .hero-document header strong {
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .hero-document header small {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 8px;
  }
  .doc-rule {
    margin: 13px 0 19px;
    border-top: 3px double #172033;
  }
  .doc-date {
    text-align: right;
  }
  .doc-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin: 25px 0 22px;
  }
  .doc-title strong {
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .hero-document dl div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 82px 1fr;
  }
  .hero-document dt,
  .hero-document dd {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .hero-document > p {
    text-align: justify;
  }
  .doc-sign {
    width: 48%;
    margin: 44px 0 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .doc-sign b {
    margin-top: 56px;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .visual-chip {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 12px 15px;
    border: 1px solid #e1e7ef;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #ffffffed;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px #16243d26;
  }
  .visual-chip i {
    display: grid;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #dcfce7;
    color: #15803d;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  .visual-chip span {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .visual-chip strong {
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .visual-chip small {
    color: #8a94a4;
    font-size: 8px;
  }
  .chip-top {
    top: 85px;
    right: -5px;
  }
  .chip-bottom {
    bottom: 74px;
    left: -13px;
  }
  .chip-bottom i {
    background: #fff5d9;
    color: #a16e00;
  }
  .trust-strip {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 94px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 65px;
    border-block: 1px solid #e1e6ed;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .trust-strip > span {
    color: #9aa3b2;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.17em;
  }
  .trust-strip div {
    display: flex;
    gap: 48px;
  }
  .trust-strip b {
    color: #657185;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .section-wrap {
    width: min(1240px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .feature-section,
  .template-showcase {
    padding: 115px 0;
  }
  .section-intro {
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  .section-kicker {
    color: #2563eb;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }
  .section-intro h2,
  .workflow-copy h2 {
    margin: 12px 0 15px;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
  }
  .section-intro p,
  .workflow-copy > p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #737e90;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .feature-bento {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 0.75fr 0.75fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .feature-bento article {
    min-height: 210px;
    padding: 27px;
    border: 1px solid #e0e6ee;
    border-radius: 17px;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .feature-bento h3 {
    margin: 18px 0 8px;
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .feature-bento p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #748094;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .feature-large {
    grid-row: span 2;
  }
  .feature-number {
    color: #a6b0bf;
    font-size: 10px;
  }
  .mini-editor {
    margin: 20px 0 26px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #dfe5ee;
    border-radius: 11px;
    background: #fbfcfe;
  }
  .mini-editor > div {
    display: flex;
    gap: 19px;
    padding: 11px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5eaf1;
  }
  .mini-editor p {
    padding: 0 17px;
    color: #2a3447;
  }
  .feature-icon {
    display: grid;
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 11px;
    background: #eef5ff;
    color: #2563eb;
    font-weight: 850;
  }
  .feature-dark {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #152847, #0e1c33) !important;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .feature-dark p {
    color: #bac7d9 !important;
  }
  .feature-dark .feature-icon {
    background: #ffffff17;
    color: #f1c94d;
  }
  .consistency-line {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 27px;
  }
  .consistency-line i {
    grid-column: 1/-1;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e6bd43, #f4d777);
  }
  .workflow-section {
    padding: 110px 0;
    background: #142746;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .workflow-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 100px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .section-kicker.gold {
    color: #e9c456;
  }
  .workflow-copy > p {
    color: #b8c4d5;
  }
  .workflow-copy > a {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 26px;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .workflow-grid ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .workflow-grid li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 55px 1fr;
    gap: 21px;
    padding: 27px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff1c;
  }
  .workflow-grid li > span {
    color: #e9c456;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 22px;
  }
  .workflow-grid li strong {
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  .workflow-grid li p {
    margin: 7px 0 0;
    color: #aebcd0;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .centered {
    margin: auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .template-tags {
    display: flex;
    max-width: 1020px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 11px;
    margin: 40px auto 0;
  }
  .template-tags span {
    padding: 13px 17px;
    border: 1px solid #dce3ed;
    border-radius: 11px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #48566b;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .template-tags span:last-child {
    border-color: #9dbdfb;
    background: #edf4ff;
    color: #1d4ed8;
  }
  .final-cta {
    display: flex;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 90px;
    padding: 55px 60px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(125deg, #1a3156, #10213d);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .final-cta > div > span {
    color: #e7c252;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .final-cta h2 {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 11px 0 10px;
    font-size: 34px;
    line-height: 1.14;
  }
  .final-cta p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #b9c6d7;
  }
  .final-cta > a {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 52px;
    flex: none;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 17px;
    padding: 0 22px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #172b4d;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .marketing-footer {
    display: flex;
    width: min(1240px, calc(100% - 48px));
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
